      "topic": "Hermes Size Creep Analysis",
      "source": "SpaceTomatoGG",
      "tweet_id": "2017399887567196552",
      "submitted_at": "2026-01-30T22:03:00-06:00",
      "draft": "**RSI Hermes Doubles in Size from Original Concept**\n\nSpace Tomato has revealed just how much the RSI Hermes has grown from its original Apollo/Hermes concept. According to his analysis with video evidence, the original concept was only about 4 meters longer than a MISC Freelancer.\n\nThe current implementation? Significantly larger. The video comparison shows the dramatic difference in scale, highlighting another case of Star Citizen's notorious ship size creep.\n\n🔗 https://twitter.com/SpaceTomatoGG/status/2017399887567196552"
    },
