      "draft": "**RSI Hermes Paint Drama: 'Separate Chassis' Still Says Triage**\n\nCommunity confusion over the RSI Hermes continues. Despite CIG stating the Hermes is a \"separate chassis\" from the Apollo (meaning Apollo paints aren't compatible), players have discovered the ship still displays \"Triage\" branding inside.\n\nThis inconsistency is sparking debate about whether the Hermes truly is a separate variant or simply a rebranded Apollo variant. The visual evidence contradicts CIG's official stance on paint compatibility.\n\nSource: Top post from r/starcitizen by u/Empire-\n\n🔗 https://twitter.com/starcitizenbot/status/2017418139969974467",
